### Leo VI's Odds and Ends - texticons.
###
### Texticons are collected from every gui file, so these are additive and
### override nothing.

# Prefixes the Governors map mode's name, the way vanilla's map mode names carry
# an icon (@epidemic_icon! Plagues, @county_fertility_icon! County Fertility).
# Copies the shape of vanilla's landless_rulers_icon, which draws the same kind
# of government-type art inline; see game/gui/texticons.gui.
texticon = {
	icon = leo_oae_governor_icon
	iconsize = {
		texture = "gfx/interface/icons/government_types/administrative_government.dds"
		size = { 25 25 }
		offset = { 0 6 }
		fontsize = 16
		uv ={ 0.05 0.05 1 1 }
	}
}
